---
config:
  sequence:
    wrap: false
    width: 180
    noteMargin: 8
title: "Code · sequence: draft, review and export one case (UC2–UC4, UC6)"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor R as Researcher
  participant UI as ui.streamlit_app
  participant WS as Workspace
  participant PL as drafting.pipelines
  participant VC as verification.checks
  participant RS as review.session<br/>ReviewSession
  participant EP as export.report
  participant DX as export.content ·<br/>export.docx_report

  Note over R,UI: tab 2 · Concept maken
  R->>UI: section, pipeline, model
  UI->>WS: generate(case, section, PipelineConfig, model_id, reviewer)
  WS->>PL: run_pipeline(pack, cfg, provider)
  PL-->>WS: SectionDraft
  WS->>VC: verify_section(draft, pack, evidence_index)
  VC-->>WS: verification stored on every claim
  Note over WS: save_draft → drafts/<case>/<section>/<draft_id>.json<br/>an earlier review of this section is moved to reviews/<case>/archive
  WS->>RS: ReviewSession.start(draft, reviewer)
  RS-->>WS: session with event 1 = start
  WS->>WS: save_session

  Note over R,UI: tab 3 · Beoordelen (claim, its status and flags, its evidence and source cells)
  UI->>WS: session(case, section)
  WS->>RS: load(path) · attach_index(evidence_index)
  RS-->>UI: states(): ClaimState per claim (rebuilt from the events)
  alt approve
    R->>UI: approve claim
    UI->>RS: approve(claim_id, actor)
    alt verifier status is weak or unsupported
      RS-->>UI: NeedsOverride
      R->>UI: confirm the override
      UI->>RS: approve(claim_id, actor, confirm_override=True)
      Note over RS: event override_approve (status kept on the event)
    else grounded
      Note over RS: event approve
    end
  else edit
    R->>UI: new text (and evidence ids)
    UI->>RS: edit(claim_id, new_text, actor, evidence_ids)
    RS->>VC: verify_claim(edited text, its evidence)
    VC-->>RS: recheck result
    Note over RS: event edit: before, after, recheck (AI text kept)
  else reject, comment, reopen, add_claim
    UI->>RS: reject / comment / reopen / add_claim
  end
  Note over RS: every event: seq, ts, actor, prev_hash, hash (SHA-256 chain)
  UI->>WS: save_session(session)

  Note over R,UI: tab 4 · Exporteren
  UI->>WS: export_blockers(case)
  WS->>EP: blocking_reasons(report_inputs)
  Note over EP: a required section without a draft · claims still pending ·<br/>verify_chain() finds an altered log
  EP-->>UI: reasons (empty = ready)
  R->>UI: export (final, or preview with CONCEPT banner)
  UI->>WS: export(case, preview)
  WS->>EP: export_case(report_inputs, exports/<case>, preview)
  alt reasons and not preview
    EP-->>WS: ExportBlocked(reasons)
  else ready, or preview
    Note over EP: render_markdown: approved and edited claims with<br/>evidence ids · Methode · Bronnenlijst · Bijlage · evidence_map_csv
    EP-->>WS: .md and evidence_map_<case>.csv
    WS->>DX: from_sessions(ws, case, preview) → render_docx
    Note over DX: WijkscanRenderer.build: cover, chapters, maps,<br/>charts from survey data, Bijlagen
    DX-->>WS: .docx (and .pdf via LibreOffice if asked)
  end
  WS-->>UI: file paths to download
